From: OnePlus 15 recovery maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] libsnapshot: export public update-engine header dependency

Public cow_reader.h includes payload_consumer/file_descriptor.h. Export the
already declared header dependency to consumers such as recovery libinstall.
Keep snapshot implementation and OTA safeguards unchanged.

diff --git a/fs_mgr/libsnapshot/Android.bp b/fs_mgr/libsnapshot/Android.bp
--- a/fs_mgr/libsnapshot/Android.bp
+++ b/fs_mgr/libsnapshot/Android.bp
@@ -60,6 +60,7 @@ cc_defaults {
     ],
     export_header_lib_headers: [
         "libfiemap_headers",
+        "libupdate_engine_headers",
     ],
     export_include_dirs: ["include"],
     proto: {
